# Vendored Lenis

This directory contains the unmodified Lenis 1.3.27 browser distribution (`lenis.min.js` and `lenis.css`), downloaded from the official package distribution at `https://unpkg.com/lenis@1.3.27/`.

Lenis is copyright darkroom.engineering and distributed under the MIT License. See [`lenis.LICENSE`](lenis.LICENSE).
</file>

