        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="account-content container" data-auth-signed-in hidden>
        <div class="account-grid">
          <article class="account-panel account-profile-panel">
            <div class="account-panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BIDDER PROFILE &amp; CAPACITY</p><h2>Your business basics</h2></div><span class="account-chip">PRIVATE TO YOUR ACCOUNT</span></div>
            <p class="account-copy">This profile syncs across your devices via Supabase Postgres and can pre-fill the 5-Pillar Strategy Studio in one click. It does not by itself decide whether you qualify for a tender.</p>
            <form class="account-profile-form" data-account-profile-form>
              <label class="profile-field" for="account-full-name">Your name<input id="account-full-name" name="full_name" type="text" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100"></label>
              <label class="profile-field" for="account-organization">Organization name<input id="account-organization" name="organization" type="text" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="100" placeholder="Company or bidder name" required></label>
              <div class="profile-form-grid">
                <label class="profile-field" for="account-bidder-type">Bidder type<select id="account-bidder-type" name="bidder_type"><option value="">Choose a type</option><option value="Manufacturer">Manufacturer / OEM</option><option value="EPC">EPC / works contractor</option><option value="Reseller">Dealer / reseller</option><option value="System Integrator">System Integrator / IT</option><option value="Trader">Trader</option><option value="Other">Other</option></select></label>
                <label class="profile-field" for="account-years">Years in business (range)<select id="account-years" name="years_active"><option value="">Choose a range</option><option value="under-3">Under 3 years</option><option value="3-5">3–5 years</option><option value="6-10">6–10 years</option><option value="10-plus">Over 10 years</option></select></label>
                <label class="profile-field" for="account-region">Operating region<input id="account-region" name="region" type="text" autocomplete="address-level1" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Delhi NCR / Haryana"></label>
              </div>

              <details class="strategy-draft-details account-capacity-details" open>
                <summary>Optional: Statutory &amp; Financial Capacity (for Strategy Studio pre-fill)</summary>
                <div class="account-capacity-grid">
                  <div class="strategy-checkbox-row">
                    <label class="strategy-check"><input id="account-is-msme" name="is_msme_registered" type="checkbox"><span>Registered MSME (Udyam)</span></label>
                    <label class="strategy-check"><input id="account-is-startup" name="is_startup_recognized" type="checkbox"><span>DPIIT Recognized Startup</span></label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="profile-form-grid">
                    <label class="profile-field" for="account-msme-category">MSME category<select id="account-msme-category" name="msme_category"><option value="">Not applicable</option><option value="MICRO">Micro Enterprise</option><option value="SMALL">Small Enterprise</option><option value="MEDIUM">Medium Enterprise</option></select></label>
                    <label class="profile-field" for="account-years-numeric">Exact years in business<input id="account-years-numeric" name="years_in_business" type="number" min="0" max="150" step="1" placeholder="e.g. 6"></label>
                    <label class="profile-field" for="account-local-content">Make in India local content · %<input id="account-local-content" name="local_content_percentage" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" placeholder="e.g. 65"></label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="profile-form-grid">
                    <label class="profile-field" for="account-turnover-1">Turnover Year 1 · ₹ lakh<input id="account-turnover-1" name="turnover_year_1_lakhs" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="e.g. 180"></label>
                    <label class="profile-field" for="account-turnover-2">Turnover Year 2 · ₹ lakh<input id="account-turnover-2" name="turnover_year_2_lakhs" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="e.g. 210"></label>
                    <label class="profile-field" for="account-turnover-3">Turnover Year 3 · ₹ lakh<input id="account-turnover-3" name="turnover_year_3_lakhs" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="e.g. 240"></label>
                  </div>
                  <label class="profile-field" for="account-certifications">Held certifications <small>Comma-separated</small><input id="account-certifications" name="held_certifications" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="e.g. ISO-9001, BIS, CE"></label>
                </div>
              </details>

              <div class="account-form-actions"><button class="auth-submit" type="submit">Save profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="auth-status" data-account-profile-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
            </form>
          </article>
          <aside class="account-side-stack">
            <div class="account-side-card"><span class="account-side-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><p class="eyebrow">SAVED NOTICES</p><h2>Keep a shortlist of real opportunities.</h2><p>Save live tender links from the search results. Fictional samples stay local and are never added here.</p><a class="text-link" href="saved-tenders.html">Open saved tenders <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
            <div class="account-side-card"><span class="account-side-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚡</span><p class="eyebrow">5-PILLAR STRATEGY STUDIO</p><h2>Test against any tender schedule.</h2><p>Use your saved profile to run deterministic gates, pre-bid legal queries, JV gap analysis, compliance matrices, and EMD optimization.</p><a class="text-link" href="strategy.html">Launch Strategy Studio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
          </aside>
        </div>
        <div class="account-privacy-note"><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><p><strong>Only non-confidential business details belong here.</strong><br>Avoid tax IDs, bank account numbers, passwords, private bid documents and confidential records.</p></div>
      </section>
      <section class="account-guard container" data-auth-signed-out>
        <div class="account-guard-card"><span class="account-side-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><h2>Sign in to open your workspace</h2><p>Your bidder profile and saved notices appear here after you sign in.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="signin.html?next=account.html">Sign in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="signup.html">Create an account <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="auth-config-hint" data-auth-config-needed hidden>Local setup is needed before sign-in can work. <a href="guide.html#account-setup">See account setup</a>.</p><p class="auth-status" data-auth-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
      </section>
