          <div class="strategy-submit-row"><button class="auth-submit" id="strategy-submit" type="submit">Create review
              preview <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button class="strategy-reset" type="reset">Clear
              form</button></div>
          <p class="auth-status" id="strategy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <aside class="strategy-side-note">
        <p class="eyebrow">WHAT THE STUDIO DOES</p>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Deterministic math gates</strong><span>3Y average turnover, CPWD 80/50/40 ratios, MII Class-I/II,
              and set-difference certification checks run in pure Python.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Statutory citation trail</strong><span>Maps GFR 2017 Rules 144(xi), 170(i), 173(i), DPIIT MII
              Order 2017, and CVC guidelines to entered figures.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Ready-to-review templates</strong><span>Generates pre-bid query letters, CSV compliance matrices,
              and draft statutory undertakings.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="strategy-side-foot">The preview endpoint calculates results deterministically without storing your
          form inputs.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="guide.html">Read the easy guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="strategy-results container" id="strategy-results" hidden aria-labelledby="strategy-results-title">
      <div class="strategy-results-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">YOUR 5-PILLAR REVIEW PACK</p>
          <h2 id="strategy-results-title">Five pillars, one deterministic source trail.</h2>
          <p id="strategy-result-context"></p>
        </div>
        <button class="strategy-reset" type="button" data-new-preview>Edit inputs ↑</button>
      </div>

      <div class="strategy-gates-overview">
        <div class="strategy-card-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">DETERMINISTIC GATEKEEPER</p>
            <h3>Mathematical &amp; Statutory Gate Results</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="strategy-gate-summary-badge" data-gate-summary-badge></span>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy-gate-grid" data-strategy-gate-grid></div>
      </div>

      <div class="strategy-output-grid">
        <article class="strategy-output-card">
          <div class="strategy-card-heading">
            <div>
