              <h3>Statutory challenges &amp; corrigendum requests</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="demo-login-badge" data-prebid-count-badge>0</span>
          </div>
          <p class="strategy-output-copy">Draft questions citing CVC, GFR 2017, and DPIIT orders for buyer review via
            the official portal window.</p>
          <ul class="strategy-rich-list" data-prebid-list></ul>
          <details class="strategy-draft-details" open>
            <summary>View &amp; copy formal representation letter</summary>
            <div class="strategy-letter-actions">
              <button class="demo-login-fill" type="button" data-copy-prebid>Copy letter</button>
              <button class="demo-login-fill" type="button" data-download-prebid>Download .pdf ↓</button>
            </div>
            <pre data-prebid-letter></pre>
          </details>
        </article>

        <article class="strategy-output-card">
          <div class="strategy-card-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow" id="pillar-2-jv">02 · CONSORTIUM &amp; CAPABILITY GAP MATCHMAKER</p>
              <h3>Quantified shortfalls &amp; illustrative JV archetypes</h3>
