          </details>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="strategy-rag-section container" id="precedence-rag-workbench" aria-labelledby="rag-workbench-title">
      <div class="strategy-results-heading">
        <div>
          <h2 id="rag-workbench-title">Test how a later Corrigendum overrides an earlier clause.</h2>
          <p>Indian tenders span multiple PDFs. TenderLens builds a Directed Acyclic Graph (Rank 1 Corrigendum → Rank 2
            GeM ATC → Rank 3 Buyer ATC → Rank 5 Main Tender) so superseded terms never mislead your review.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy-preset-buttons">
          <button class="demo-login-fill" type="button" data-rag-preset="turnover-override">Scenario A: Turnover &amp;
            MSME Override</button>
          <button class="demo-login-fill" type="button" data-rag-preset="emd-relaxation">Scenario B: Corrigendum EMD
            Reduction</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="strategy-rag-grid">
        <form class="strategy-rag-form" id="rag-workbench-form">
