          <div class="faq-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> 07 / FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</p><h2 id="faq-title">A few things to know.</h2><p>New to TenderLens? These answers explain how the sample and account features work.</p></div>
