            <details><summary>Can I check if my company qualifies?</summary><p>Yes! Open the <strong><a href='strategy.html'>Strategy Studio</a></strong> to run an instant deterministic check. It validates your turnover, experience, and DPIIT/MSME statutory exemptions with zero math hallucinations.</p></details>
